Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790294399999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": false, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790207999999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The 27 bars from 1787356800000 to 1789603200000 are a genuine trading range (2357.18-2680) with overlapping bars and no net progress, so much of the post-spike period is two-sided rather than a clean channel.", "The final bar 1790121600000 closed 2684.16, near the low of its range (close ~29%), back below the 2680 range top and the 2700 high of bar 1789776000000, so the breakout above the range has no follow-through yet.", "Bar 1787270400000 closed 2515.3 with a 255.7 upper tail after reaching 2771, showing sellers active near the highs; price then spent 27 bars below that high before exceeding it.", "The first ~70% of the window is a bear leg to 1368.42 plus a wide 1512.91-1974.46 range; a sustained bull trend is only visible from bar 1787097600000 onward, so the bull regime rests on the newer portion of the window."], "evidence_for": ["Two very large bull trend bars anchor the bull read: bar 1787097600000 (close 2252.16, top ~87% of range) and bar 1789948800000 (close 2775.61, top ~64% of a 208.3 range, new window high 2850).", "Swing sequence since the post-spike low is up: low 2358.62 (bar 1789430400000) held just above 2357.18 (bar 1788307200000) and was followed by a higher high at 2850.", "Bars 1789689600000-1789948800000 closed on progressively higher levels and closed above the 2680 top of the preceding 27-bar range, i.e. a breakout attempt at the upper boundary rather than at the lower one.", "The current pullback is shallow so far: two bars and 2641.37, roughly a 42% retrace of the 2358.62-2850 leg, and far above the 2357.18 range low, so no higher low has been broken."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed D1 bars from 1779840000000 to 1790207999999; window low 1368.42 (bar 1780704000000 low), window high 2850 (bar 1789948800000 high).", "Opening bear leg: bars 1779840000000-1780704000000 fell from bar-0 high 2094.02 to bar-10 low 1368.42, with five consecutive lower closes (1859.02, 1813.04, 1731, 1581.32, 1568.55) and large bear ranges.", "Bars 1780790400000-1787011200000 stayed two-sided inside 1512.91 (bar-30 low) to 1974.46 (bar-61 high), heavy bar overlap, small bodies, no sustained trend.", "Bar 1787097600000 was the window's largest bull bar: open 1916.51, high 2293.8, low 1905.63, close 2252.16 (range 388.17, close in top ~87% of the bar).", "Bars 1787184000000-1787270400000 extended to highs 2348.02 and 2771, but the second closed 2515.3 with a 255.7 upper tail (close near 43% of its 445.69 range).", "Bars 1787356800000-1789603200000 traded sideways between 2357.18 (bar 1788307200000 low) and 2680 (bar 1789084800000 high) with overlapping bars and repeated two-sided closes.", "Bars 1789689600000-1789948800000 advanced from open 2446.22 to high 2850, closing above the 2680 top of that 27-bar range; the last bar of the leg, 1789948800000, closed 2775.61 in the top ~64% of its 208.3 range.", "Final two bars pulled back: 1789948800000 close 2752.43 and bar 1790121600000 open 2752.43, high 2786.81, low 2641.37, close 2684.16 (close near 29% of its 145.44 range), back below the 2680-2700 area.", "Pullback low 2641.37 retraces about 42% of the 2358.62-2850 advance, and recent swing sequence remains 2358.62 low (bar 1789430400000) vs 2357.18 (bar 1788307200000) with a higher high at 2850."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Opening bear leg: ten bars of lower closes from bar-0 high 2094.02 down to bar-10 low 1368.42, dominated by five consecutive large bear bars; the low was not revisited for the rest of the window.", "end_time_ms": 1780704000000, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779840000000, "upper_boundary": "2094.02"}, {"description": "Broad two-sided range after the bear leg, from bar-30 low 1512.91 to bar-61 high 1974.46; overlapping bars, small bodies, no clean trend bars in either direction.", "end_time_ms": 1787011200000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike from bar 1787097600000 (open 1916.51, close 2252.16, low 1905.63) through highs 2348.02 and 2771; the spike closed the range at 1512.91-1974.46 and is the largest single-bar expansion in the window.", "end_time_ms": 1787270400000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Post-spike trading range, 27 bars between bar 1788307200000 low 2357.18 and bar 1789084800000 high 2680; repeated overlapping bars and mid-bar closes show two-sided trading below the 2771 spike high.", "end_time_ms": 1789603200000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Four-bar bull leg from bar 1789689600000 (open 2446.22, low 2436.87) up to the window high 2850 at bar 1789948800000, closing above the 2357.18-2680 range top; bars 1790035200000 and 1790121600000 then pulled back to 2641.37 and closed back below the 2680-2700 area, so acceptance above the range is not yet shown.", "end_time_ms": 1789948800000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789689600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: a close above 2850, or two consecutive closes above 2786.81 (bar 1790121600000 high), would show acceptance above the range and make the current phase spike-like rather than channel-like.", "Range/failed breakout: a close below 2641.37 (bar 1790121600000 low) followed by a close below 2436.87 (bar 1789689600000 low) would return price into the 2357.18-2680 range and shift the read toward trading-range/range.", "Bull-trend invalidation: a close below 2357.18 would break the range low and the higher-low sequence, re-opening a bear leg toward the 1789430400000 low area.", "A sequence of overlapping bars holding between 2680 and 2850 with no new high would confirm the recent advance as a channel segment inside an increasingly range-like structure."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": false, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790279999999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Since 2850 both highs and lows are falling (2795, 2804.59, 2786.81, 2699.39 versus 2716.01 then 2633.31), and 2633.31 trades back inside the 2658.06-2850 spike bar, so the spike has not held its own low.", "The pullback retraces about 60% of the 2486.12-2850 leg, deeper than a typical bull flag, and contains two large bear bars closing in their lower halves (1790164800000: 2726.71 to close 2659; 1790236800000: 2692.23 to close 2647.9).", "Bar 1789128000000 shows the same pattern earlier in the window: a spike to 2680 that was fully retraced into a ~250-point decline to 2358.62, so spikes in this window have not guaranteed follow-through.", "The 20 bars since 2850 are mostly overlapping with a slightly negative net change (close 2723.15 to close 2694.09) and price now sits below the midpoint of that range, which fits a trading range at least as well as a bull trend."], "evidence_for": ["Higher swing lows through the second half of the window: 2358.62 then 2370.54, 2436.87, 2486.12, with price holding above the 2482.09 base that broke at bar 1789732800000.", "The 2436.87-2850 leg is the largest directional move in the window and is made of bull bars closing near their highs (1789732800000: 2507.15/2585.5/2495.82/2578.6; 1789948800000: 2642.9/2700/2641.7/2664.73; 1789977600000: 2658.81/2850/2658.06/2723.15).", "The last two bars (1790251200000 close 2682.25, 1790265600000 close 2694.09) are bull bars closing in the upper third after testing 2640 and 2660.49, so the pullback is holding above the breakout base.", "The window closes above where it opened (2454.36 to 2694.09) and the pullback low 2633.31 remains well above the prior higher low 2486.12, so no bull structure level has been broken."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed H4 bars, open 1788552000000 to close 1790279999999; first close 2454.36, last bar 1790265600000 closes 2694.09 (open 2682.25, high 2699.39, low 2660.49).", "Window high 2850 (bar 1789977600000: open 2658.81, high 2850, low 2658.06, close 2723.15; 191.94 range, closes 126.85 below the high). Window low 2358.62 (bar 1789488000000, close 2412.95).", "Bars 1788552000000-1789127999999 rotate in a 2411.04-2528.8 band with heavy overlap; bar 1789128000000 spikes from 2457.12 to 2680 but closes 2555.52, and price fully retraces that spike down to 2358.62 by bar 1789488000000.", "Bull leg from 2436.87 (bar 1789689600000) to 2850 (bar 1789977600000) contains a spike bar (1789732800000: 2507.15 to close 2578.6, high 2585.5) and ~15 overlapping bars rising between 2604.75 and 2700.", "After 2850 the market makes lower highs 2795 (1789992000000), 2804.59 (1790020800000), 2786.81 (1790136000000), 2699.39 (1790265600000) and lower pullback lows 2716.01 (1790049600000) then 2633.31 (1790236800000); 2633.31 undercuts the spike bar low 2658.06 by 24.75.", "The pullback from 2850 to 2633.31 retraces 216.69 of the 363.88-point 2486.12-2850 leg (~60%).", "Final six bars (1790193600000-1790265600000) overlap; five are contained in 2660.49-2699.39. Bars 1790164800000 (open 2726.71, close 2659) and 1790236800000 (open 2692.23, close 2647.9) are large bear bars; the last two bars close 2682.25 (low 2640) and 2694.09 (low 2660.49) in the upper third of their ranges."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Opening two-sided chop: ~40 bars rotating between 2411.04 (bar 1789041600000 low) and 2528.8 (bar 1788739200000 high) with small ranges and heavy overlap; no sustained breakout.", "end_time_ms": 1789127999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2411.04", "start_time_ms": 1788552000000, "upper_boundary": "2528.8"}, {"description": "Failed bull breakout attempt: bar 1789128000000 opens 2457.12, tags 2680 and closes 2555.52 with a large upper tail; follow-through bar 1789142400000 stalls at 2607.62 and the entire spike is retraced.", "end_time_ms": 1789142399999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2444.19", "start_time_ms": 1789128000000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Two-legged bear leg off the 2609.02 lower high (bar 1789416000000) down to the window low 2358.62 (bar 1789488000000), built from large bear bars closing on their lows (1789473600000: 2475.02 to close 2423.29; 1789488000000: 2423.22 to close 2412.95).", "end_time_ms": 1789502399999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789416000000, "upper_boundary": "2609.02"}, {"description": "Base after the 2358.62 low: ~15 overlapping bars rotating between 2370.54 (bar 1789574400000 low) and 2482.09 (bar 1789689600000 high) before the bull breakout.", "end_time_ms": 1789703999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2370.54", "start_time_ms": 1789502400000, "upper_boundary": "2482.09"}, {"description": "Bull breakout leg from 2436.87 (bar 1789689600000 low) to the window high 2850 (bar 1789977600000): spike bar 1789732800000, a rising channel between 2604.75 and 2700, then a second spike bar closing 2723.15.", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789689600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Post-spike two-sided range: the 20 bars after 2850 rotate between 2633.31 (bar 1790236800000 low) and 2804.59 (bar 1790020800000 high) with a slightly negative net change; the final six bars overlap in a 2633.31-2699.39 band.", "end_time_ms": 1790279999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1789992000000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Bull resumption: a close above 2804.59 and then a break of 2850 with the next bar holding the gain; a smaller version is a close above 2699.39 out of the final six-bar overlap with follow-through.", "Bear shift: a close below 2633.31 followed by another lower close without immediate recovery, which would confirm a break of the post-spike range and make a lower high below 2699.39 or 2786.81 likely.", "Continued two-sided overlap between 2633.31 and 2804.59 keeps the phase as range and Always-In relevance low; a recovery above 2716.01-2727.22 without a new low would favor a bull-flag resolution instead."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2626", "close_time_ms": 1789865999999, "high": "2633.05", "low": "2625.83", "open": "2632.98", "open_time_ms": 1789862400000, "volume": "1064468.393"}, {"close": "2617.83", "close_time_ms": 1789869599999, "high": "2626", "low": "2614.02", "open": "2626", "open_time_ms": 1789866000000, "volume": "1735693.359"}, {"close": "2573.13", "close_time_ms": 1789873199999, "high": "2622.64", "low": "2571", "open": "2617.83", "open_time_ms": 1789869600000, "volume": "2568125.853"}, {"close": "2586.68", "close_time_ms": 1789876799999, "high": "2594.57", "low": "2569.8", "open": "2572.94", "open_time_ms": 1789873200000, "volume": "2069600.079"}, {"close": "2580.35", "close_time_ms": 1789880399999, "high": "2586.73", "low": "2578.33", "open": "2586.68", "open_time_ms": 1789876800000, "volume": "1633257.163"}, {"close": "2577.06", "close_time_ms": 1789883999999, "high": "2583.44", "low": "2573.82", "open": "2578.56", "open_time_ms": 1789880400000, "volume": "1820643.41"}, {"close": "2574.06", "close_time_ms": 1789887599999, "high": "2583.54", "low": "25